# Milestone 9 network play on a TX through the loopback link. Hosts a game
# on Joust, which the second copy in the app doesn't have, so it gets the
# map; leaves at tick 1500; then joins the second copy's game on Joust and
# gets the map from it. Debug build with EXTRA="-DLOOPBACK_TEST
# -DTEST_LEAVE_AT=1500 -DAUTOQUIT_SECONDS=95"; install Joust.pdb (made by
# tools/map2pdb.py) with the app. Times are ms after launch and settle.
